+  * [The four stages of learning to code](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VHAXJxcHA1k&list=PLXtTjtWmQhg1YRG0L0dIT5B22Utujaq20&index=83) : understand this process keeps you on track 
+
+#### The power of persistence : 
+
+* what is the most important skill ? 
+* it is not technical , 
+* it is **persistence** 
+* if you stick to something, you will get better if not giveup 
+* this is a natural part of programming 
+
