+   3. recommended to check the **pre-requests** 
+   4. learn and recognize that you don't yet have all the answers 
+##### plan too  much 
+1. just finish what you have, then look for other courses 
+2. don;t try and make long-term decisions on where you're going and what you;re doing 
+
+#### Consions and confidence 
+1. you recognize the skill you need 
+2. there is a value to learn new skill 
+3. mistakes are integral part of this stage 
+   * if you have a lot of mistakes, then learn basics 
+
+#### Conscious Competence
+1. you have progressed 
+2. but still uncertain at some points 
+3. you need to immerse yourself 
+
+#### Unconscious competence 
+* you have done so much training 
+* you find that programming is easy 
+* things coming to you automatically
+* you can teach these materials to others 
+* challenge s
+  * if getting new programming language, you will get a bit frustrated 
+
+#### Final Advice
+
+##### Practice and study regularly
